WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.860
Module 4.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:02.780
Yield.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.695
Part of Stage 2, Practitioner.

00:00:05.995 --> 00:00:08.590
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:11.254
able to split any APY into organic vs

00:00:11.254 --> 00:00:14.710
subsidised, and name the risk being paid for.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.065
That's the standard.

00:00:16.065 --> 00:00:18.035
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:19.335 --> 00:00:21.624
There are 8 lessons, starting with

00:00:21.624 --> 00:00:24.475
Yield farming: base yield vs emissions.

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:26.454
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:26.454 --> 00:00:28.725
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:31.627
If the topic is new to

00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:34.435
you, start with Mastery Starter 4.0.

00:00:34.435 --> 00:00:36.330
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.484
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:38.484 --> 00:00:40.615
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:40.615 --> 00:00:42.422
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:44.455
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:45.755 --> 00:00:48.260
Let's begin, with lesson 4.0.
